{
  "schema": "pelican.studio_scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "gui_build_audio_reactive",
  "description": "AB-1s (GB-4 target 3, a drawing that reacts to sound), from File > New Project > Blank with Studio's GUI only. gui_build_audio_reactive.prepare.py writes, outside the project, a quiet one-second WAV whose loudness changes over time (silence, then a 62.5 Hz tone at -20 dBFS from 0.5 s) and the same sound the other way round. File > Import Sound copies the first into assets/audio, the palette's audio.playback plays it, and its Sound fields' Bake analysis... (decision 1) bakes RMS and 4 bands (Peak unchecked, Bands 8 -> 4 with the keyboard) into assets/analysis/beat.ktx2; the bake's row says so. The scenario writes the fragment shader (an editor of one's own): its right half reads band 0 of the table on the GPU (pelican_sample_table, decision 3), its left half the number a render.buffer hands it (the CPU path, decision 2), under a fixed 0.5 band. Use in Graph places value.sample_table on rms (decision 2). A fullscreen pass draws with the shader onto present; with the pass picked, Use in a shader places the table as a persistent image and its layout as a vec4 buffer (rows_per_feature, sample_count, hop_seconds from the layout, the scene time from the clock) in one edit, connected to the shader's bindings 0 and 1, and gives the line to copy. The Timeline follows the value.sample_table; with Live, a press at its left end (scene time 0, silence) and its right end (1 s, the tone) changes the right half (b, the GPU path). Then the palette's render.buffer, the value.sample_table dragged onto its value and the buffer onto the pass's binding 2: the left half changes the same way (a, the CPU path). Last (decision 4): the other sound copied over the project's makes the table stale (Refresh reads list_derived_assets), the value.sample_table's band says stale: source_changed in orange and its fields offer Re-bake; Re-bake bakes it again with the manifest's settings, the band clears, and the graph is built again (the readers' parameters written again), so at scene time 0 -- the tone now -- the left half is no longer dark. (The sound is beat.wav so that its table's layout buffer, beat_layout, is bound before render_buffer: the engine binds a pass's buffer reads in the order of the buffers they read, which the shader's bindings 1 and 2 follow.) Typed: the project folder and name, the sound's path in the import dialog, and the palette's filters.",
  "tab": "frame_plan",
  "probe_no_automation": false,
  "steps": [
    {"label": "the fixture's engine is up", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000},
    {"label": "File > New Project...", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.file.newProject"},
    {"label": "the dialog is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the folder: this run's own artifacts", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.location", "text": "{artifacts}"},
    {"label": "the name", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.newProject.name", "text": "gb_audio"},
    {"label": "the Blank pipeline template", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.newProject.template", "text": "Blank pipeline"},
    {"label": "Create", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.newProject.create"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog", "timeout_ms": 10000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "the blank project's present is on the Frame Plan canvas", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.framePlanLogicalView::node#present", "timeout_ms": 180000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the new engine answers and has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "the Graph tab is in front", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"},
    {"label": "the canvas can edit the new document", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "write shaders/audio_level.frag (an editor of one's own)", "file": "write", "path": "{artifacts}/gb_audio/shaders/audio_level.frag", "text": "#version 460\n#extension GL_GOOGLE_include_directive : require\n#include \"pelican_sets.glsl\"\n#include \"pelican_sample_table.glsl\"\n// AB-1s: the right half reads band 0 of the baked table on the GPU; the\n// left half the number the graph hands the pass (value.sample_table through a\n// render.buffer). The top band is a fixed reference grey.\nlayout(set = PELICAN_SET_PASS_INPUT, binding = 0) uniform sampler2D beat_table;\nlayout(std430, set = PELICAN_SET_PASS_INPUT, binding = 1) readonly buffer BeatLayout { vec4 values[]; } pelican_resource_beat_layout;\nlayout(std430, set = PELICAN_SET_PASS_INPUT, binding = 2) readonly buffer Level { float values[]; } pelican_resource_value_level;\n\nlayout(location = 0) in vec2 inTexCoord;\nlayout(location = 0) out vec4 outColor;\n\nvoid main() {\n    vec4 l = pelican_resource_beat_layout.values[0];\n    float band = pelican_sample_table(beat_table, 1u, uint(l.x), uint(l.y), l.z, l.w);\n    float level = pelican_resource_value_level.values[0];\n    float shown = inTexCoord.x < 0.5 ? clamp(level * 8.0, 0.0, 1.0) : clamp(band * 6.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n    outColor = vec4(vec3(inTexCoord.y < 0.1 ? 0.5 : shown), 1.0);\n}\n"},
    {"label": "Show: Value", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.value"},
    {"label": "Show: Audio", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasShow.audio"},
    {"label": "File > Import Sound...", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.file.importSound"},
    {"label": "the import dialog", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the sound's path (made outside Studio)", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "text": "{artifacts}/incoming/beat.wav"},
    {"label": "Return opens it", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog.fileName", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "the dialog's loop ends", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 400, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioImportDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "imported", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 20000, "contains": "project://assets/audio/beat.wav"},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (audio.playback)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: audio.playback", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "audio.playback"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "audio_playback is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#audio_playback", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the voice plays the imported sound", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[1].parameters.asset", "value": "project://assets/audio/beat.wav", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the voice", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#audio_playback"},
    {"label": "decision 1: Bake analysis... beside its Sound", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioBake", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Bake analysis...", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAudioBake"},
    {"label": "the Bake dialog", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the table goes to assets/analysis/<the sound's name>.ktx2 unless changed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.out", "timeout_ms": 10000, "text": "assets/analysis/beat.ktx2"},
    {"label": "Peak off: RMS and the bands", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.peak"},
    {"label": "Bands 8 -> 7", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.bandCount", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "Bands 7 -> 6", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.bandCount", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "Bands 6 -> 5", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.bandCount", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "Bands 5 -> 4", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.bandCount", "sequence": "Down"},
    {"label": "Bake", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog.bake"},
    {"label": "the dialog closed", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.audioBakeDialog", "timeout_ms": 20000, "missing": true},
    {"label": "decision 1: committed -- the row says the table, its rows and its samples", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasBake.line", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Baked assets/analysis/beat.ktx2: rms, band:0..band:3 × 101 samples"},
    {"label": "the table is in the project", "file": "exists", "path": "{artifacts}/gb_audio/assets/analysis/beat.ktx2", "value": true},
    {"label": "with its manifest beside it", "file": "exists", "path": "{artifacts}/gb_audio/assets/analysis/beat.ktx2.import.json", "value": true},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "decision 2: Use in Graph", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasBake.useInGraph"},
    {"label": "value_sample_table is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#value_sample_table", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "it reads the table's rms, at the scene time (no time edge)", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[2].parameters", "value": {"asset": "project://assets/analysis/beat.ktx2", "row": "rms"}, "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add fullscreen pass", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.addFullscreenPass"},
    {"label": "the pass is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#render_fullscreen", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "pick the pass", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#render_fullscreen"},
    {"label": "its Fragment field", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPass.shader.fragment", "timeout_ms": 60000, "visible": true, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Fragment: audio_level", "cmd": "select", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPass.shader.fragment", "text": "project://shaders/audio_level"},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "present's + input", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_derived_socket#present/in:+", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the pass's colour onto present's + input", "cmd": "drag", "from": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_fullscreen/out:color"}, "to": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_derived_socket#present/in:+"}, "steps": 8},
    {"label": "present's inputs saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Pass inputs saved."},
    {"label": "the pass's image binding has a socket (the reflection shows it)", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_fullscreen/in@0", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "pick the pass", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#render_fullscreen"},
    {"label": "decision 3: Use in a shader (the pass picked)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasBake.useInShader"},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the table: a persistent image that starts from it", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[5].parameters.initial.asset", "value": "assets/analysis/beat.ktx2", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "R32_SFLOAT, as the table is", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[5].parameters.format", "value": "R32_SFLOAT"},
    {"label": "the layout's numbers: rows_per_feature, sample_count, hop_seconds", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[7].parameters.value", "value": [1, 101, 0.01]},
    {"label": "and the scene time after them", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[8].inputs.value.node", "value": "scene_time"},
    {"label": "the table onto the shader's binding 0", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[4].inputs.beat_table.node", "value": "beat_table"},
    {"label": "the layout onto its buffer (pelican_resource_beat_layout)", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[4].inputs.beat_layout.node", "value": "beat_layout"},
    {"label": "the line to copy names the include's function and the image", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasBake.shaderLine", "timeout_ms": 10000, "contains": "pelican_sample_table(beat_table, 1u"},
    {"label": "the engine has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "what the root's nodes publish (read in full)", "cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "pick the value.sample_table", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#value_sample_table"},
    {"label": "Timeline", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineToggle"},
    {"label": "the strip", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "timeout_ms": 20000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "Live", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "the strip reads the table's value", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "value_sample_table.value"},
    {"label": "scrub: a press at the strip's left end (silence)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [0, 20]},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1500, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "(b) scene time 0: the GPU half, read", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[1]", "remember": "gpu_quiet"},
    {"label": "scrub: a press at the strip's right end (the tone)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [4000, 20]},
    {"label": "(b) the GPU half reads band 0 of the table: brighter", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[1]", "op": "ne", "value_of": "gpu_quiet", "retry_ms": 30000, "remember": "gpu_loud"},
    {"label": "the table's rms there (CPU), read", "cmd": "rpc", "method": "get_graph_node_values", "params": {}},
    {"label": "scrub: back to the left end", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [0, 20]},
    {"label": "(b) silence again: not the bright one", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[1]", "op": "ne", "value_of": "gpu_loud", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "Live off", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Add: the palette opens (render.buffer)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"},
    {"label": "the palette is on screen", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette", "timeout_ms": 10000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "the filter: render.buffer", "cmd": "type", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "text": "render.buffer"},
    {"label": "Enter in the filter is OK", "cmd": "key", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter", "sequence": "Return"},
    {"label": "render_buffer is drawn", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#render_buffer", "timeout_ms": 120000, "visible": true},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "a float buffer of one element", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[9].parameters", "value": {"element": "float", "size": 4}, "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "fit", "cmd": "action", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 800, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "(a) the table's value onto the buffer's value socket", "cmd": "drag", "from": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#value_sample_table/out:value"}, "to": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_buffer/in:value"}, "steps": 10},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the buffer reads the table", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[9].inputs.value.node", "value": "value_sample_table", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 800, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "(a) the buffer onto the pass's binding 2", "cmd": "drag", "from": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_buffer/out:resource"}, "to": {"name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_fullscreen/in@2"}, "steps": 10},
    {"label": "saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the pass reads it as value_level", "expect": "rpc_equals", "method": "get_graph_instances", "params": {}, "path": "nodes[4].inputs.value_level.node", "value": "render_buffer", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the engine has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "pick the value.sample_table", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#value_sample_table"},
    {"label": "Live", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "the strip reads the table's value", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphTimelineSummary", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "value_sample_table.value"},
    {"label": "scrub: the left end (silence)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [0, 20]},
    {"label": "let it settle", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "contains": "zz-never-shown", "timeout_ms": 1500, "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"},
    {"label": "(a) scene time 0: the CPU half, read", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[0]", "remember": "cpu_quiet"},
    {"label": "scrub: the right end (the tone)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [4000, 20]},
    {"label": "(a) the CPU half reads the table's rms: brighter", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[0]", "op": "ne", "value_of": "cpu_quiet", "retry_ms": 30000, "remember": "cpu_loud"},
    {"label": "a picture of the window (the tone)", "expect": "screenshot", "path": "gui_build_audio_reactive_window.png"},
    {"label": "scrub: back to the left end", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [0, 20]},
    {"label": "(a) silence again: dark", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[0]", "value_of": "cpu_quiet", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "Live off", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "decision 4: the sound changes on disk (the other one copied over the project's)", "file": "copy", "path": "{artifacts}/gb_audio/assets/audio/beat.wav", "from": "{artifacts}/incoming/beat_changed.wav"},
    {"label": "Refresh: the Graph read again (list_derived_assets)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasRefresh"},
    {"label": "the band under value_sample_table says the table is stale, and why", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_layer_band#value_sample_table", "timeout_ms": 60000, "contains": "stale: source_changed"},
    {"label": "and the image that starts from it says so too", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "text", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_layer_band#beat_table"}, "path": "text", "op": "contains", "value": "stale: source_changed", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "pick the value.sample_table", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#value_sample_table"},
    {"label": "its fields say why", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasStale.line", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true, "contains": "source_changed"},
    {"label": "and offer Re-bake", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasStale.rebake", "timeout_ms": 30000, "visible": true, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "Re-bake (the manifest's settings)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasStale.rebake"},
    {"label": "baked again", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasBake.line", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Baked assets/analysis/beat.ktx2: rms, band:0..band:3 × 101 samples"},
    {"label": "the band clears", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "text", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_layer_band#value_sample_table"}, "path": "text", "op": "excludes", "value": "stale", "retry_ms": 60000},
    {"label": "the readers written again: saved", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice", "timeout_ms": 120000, "text": "Graph change saved."},
    {"label": "the engine has presented frames", "cmd": "wait_engine", "timeout_ms": 180000, "frames": 30},
    {"label": "the canvas takes edits", "cmd": "wait", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode", "timeout_ms": 120000, "enabled": true},
    {"label": "pick the value.sample_table", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node_header#value_sample_table"},
    {"label": "Live", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "scrub: the left end (the tone, in the new sound)", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphTimeline", "point": [0, 20]},
    {"label": "(a) the graph reads the new table: scene time 0 is not dark any more", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[0]", "op": "ne", "value_of": "cpu_quiet", "retry_ms": 30000},
    {"label": "(b) the GPU half at scene time 0, read (the image starts from the new table once the engine reloads it)", "expect": "result", "command": {"cmd": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.viewportHost", "mode": "screen", "path": "{artifacts}/audio.png", "pixels": [[0.25, 0.5], [0.75, 0.5], [0.5, 0.03]]}, "path": "pixels[1]", "remember": "gpu_after_rebake"},
    {"label": "Live off", "cmd": "click", "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLive"},
    {"label": "a picture of the Graph tab", "expect": "screenshot", "name": "pelican.graphCanvas", "path": "gui_build_audio_reactive_graph.png"}
  ]
}
